WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Act 1.

2
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:05.930
A wounded captain staggers in from
the battle to report to King Duncan.

3
00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:11.760
He can't stop praising one soldier: "For
brave Macbeth (well he deserves that

4
00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:12.620
name)".

5
00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:17.300
By Act 5, the same man stands
alone, wearing a crown.

6
00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.610
The new king calls him
"this dead butcher".

7
00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:21.860
Same man.

8
00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:23.210
Five acts.

9
00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:26.140
So how does a hero become a butcher?

10
00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:29.410
In this mission, you'll
follow the story act by act,

11
00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:32.070
from the battle to the moment he falls.

12
00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:35.030
You'll see what Scotland
cheers him for at the start.

13
00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.620
It isn't gentleness.

14
00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:40.220
And you'll map the shape
of a tragedy: a rise,

15
00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:42.510
a turning point, a fall.

16
00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:45.320
Your mission: work out what went wrong.
